%N A393289 Genus of the n-path complement graph.
%C A393289 Known a(n) agree with the Euler lower bound ceil((n^2 - 9 n + 14)/12) except for n = 1, 7, 10.
%C A393289 It is conjectured that a(n) = ceiling((n^2 - 9*n + 14)/12) for all n >= 8 except a(10) = 3. - _Eric W. Weisstein_, Jul 25 2026
%C A393289 The values a(20)-a(25) were obtained by exact genus computation or from corresponding cycle-complement equality cases, with embedding certificates attaining the Euler lower bound for the computed cases. - _Eric W. Weisstein_, Jul 25 2026
%H A393289 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/GraphGenus.html">Graph Genus</a>.
